      *################################################################*00010001
      *                                                                 00020001
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030001
      *                                                                 00040001
      * Copy-area R115ISC0.                                             00050001
      *                                                                 00060001
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Sys_Code.         00070001
      *                                                                 00080001
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090001
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00100001
      * from- and to- values.                                           00110001
      *                                                                 00120001
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130001
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140001
      *                                                                 00150001
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160001
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170001
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180001
      *                                                                 00190001
      *                                                                 00200001
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210001
      *                                                                 00220001
      *    Initialize                          R115ISC0-Sys-Code        00230001
      *    Set   R115ISC0-Version        To    True                     00240001
      *    Set   R115ISC0-In-Select      To    True                     00250001
      *    Move  &sys-type               To    R115ISC0-In-ST-Type      00260003
      *    Move  &sys-code               To    R115ISC0-In-SC-Code      00270003
      *                                                                 00280001
      *    Call  'F115ISC0'              Using R115ISC0-Sys-Code        00290001
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00300004
      *    End-Call                                                     00310001
      *                                                                 00320001
      *    Evaluate True                                                00330001
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00340004
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00350004
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00360001
      *                                                                 00370001
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00380004
      *        ...not found...                                          00390001
      *                                                                 00400001
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00410004
      *        ...found...                                              00420001
      *                                                                 00430001
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00440001
      *                                                                 00450001
      *################################################################*00460001
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00470001
