             10  R115ISC0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00610001
               88  R115ISC0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00620001
               88  R115ISC0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00630001
               88  R115ISC0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00640001
               88  R115ISC0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00650001
               88  R115ISC0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00660001
               88  R115ISC0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00670001
