      *                                                                 00933017
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    00940001
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            00950001
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   00960001
      * each Get-Next.                                                  00970001
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           00980001
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       00990001
      * that complies with your qualifISCtion.                          01000001
      *                                                                 01010001
             10  R115ISC0-Out-Accumulators.                             01020001
               15  R115ISC0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01030001
               15  R115ISC0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01040001
